		<item>
		<title>10 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 9, 2026</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/10-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-afternoon-november-9-2026/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/10-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-afternoon-november-9-2026/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 21:41:40 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales & Deals]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales US]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114540</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="872" height="870" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75428-Battle-Droid-with-STAP-July-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Star Wars 75428 Battle Droid with STAP July 2025 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75428-Battle-Droid-with-STAP-July-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 872w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75428-Battle-Droid-with-STAP-July-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75428-Battle-Droid-with-STAP-July-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75428-Battle-Droid-with-STAP-July-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x766.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 872px) 100vw, 872px" /></p>
<p>Good Afternoon LEGO Fans! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for this afternoon. Free shipping on orders</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/10-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-afternoon-november-9-2026/">10 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 9, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Afternoon LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for this afternoon. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96614 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75428-Battle-Droid-with-STAP-July-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg" alt="" width="891" height="667" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75428-Battle-Droid-with-STAP-July-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg 891w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75428-Battle-Droid-with-STAP-July-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75428-Battle-Droid-with-STAP-July-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-768x575.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 891px) 100vw, 891px" /></p>
<p>My top picks include <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Star-Wars-Building-Learning/dp/B0DRW6VY43?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=0d9937b39463bf67195e920d6e1dde7d&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars: The Phantom Menace Battle Droid with STAP 75428</a> at 40% off for <strong>$83.99 </strong>(reg.$139.99) and <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Creator-Forest-Animals-Transforms/dp/B0CGY3VF3K?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=aa87483b0bc855c96bdb3c7bafe712fb&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Creator 3 in 1 Forest Animals: Red Fox 31154</a> at 30% off for <strong>$34.99</strong> (reg.$49.99).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-87905 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31154-Forest-Animals-Red-Fox-March-2024-Release-Date.jpg" alt="" width="1083" height="1083" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31154-Forest-Animals-Red-Fox-March-2024-Release-Date.jpg 1450w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31154-Forest-Animals-Red-Fox-March-2024-Release-Date-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31154-Forest-Animals-Red-Fox-March-2024-Release-Date-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31154-Forest-Animals-Red-Fox-March-2024-Release-Date-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31154-Forest-Animals-Red-Fox-March-2024-Release-Date-768x768.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1083px) 100vw, 1083px" /></p>
<p>Below are 10 of our Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 9, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>10 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 9, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>40%off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Champions-Mercedes-AMG-Minifigures-Convertible/dp/B0CV2HGNY9?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=52f98640af8c095e0519d86c4970d07a&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Speed Champions Mercedes-AMG G 63 &amp; SL 63 76924</a> <strong>$26.99</strong> (reg.$44.99)</li>
<li>39% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Icons-Williams-Racing-Mansell/dp/B0DJ19PWQF?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=2364bedbd7a5dbfc5cb3f9af652500fe&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Icons Williams Racing FW14B &amp; Nigel Mansell 10353</a> <strong>$48.49</strong> (reg.$79.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92522 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="980" height="787" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 980w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x241.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x617.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 980px) 100vw, 980px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92523 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="932" height="742" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 932w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x239.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x611.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 932px) 100vw, 932px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-89461 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-76924-Mercedes-AMG-G-63-Mercedes-AMG-SL-63-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-.jpg" alt="" width="965" height="633" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-76924-Mercedes-AMG-G-63-Mercedes-AMG-SL-63-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-.jpg 1378w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-76924-Mercedes-AMG-G-63-Mercedes-AMG-SL-63-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box--300x197.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-76924-Mercedes-AMG-G-63-Mercedes-AMG-SL-63-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box--1024x672.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-76924-Mercedes-AMG-G-63-Mercedes-AMG-SL-63-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box--768x504.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 965px) 100vw, 965px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>40% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-City-Williams-Racing-Haas/dp/B0DJ17WGMB?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=6de5304d1c2b3da7510bca2abf05e884&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO City F1 Williams Racing &amp; Haas F1 Race Car 60464</a><strong> $11.99</strong> (reg.$19.99)</li>
<li>40% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-City-Off-Road-Mountain-Truck/dp/B0DJ1BH9T1?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=4c76ec6f8ac78165951398ac4fe0d115&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO City Off-Road 4&#215;4 Mountain Truck 60447</a> <strong>$11.92</strong> (reg.$19.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-93409 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-City-60447-Off-Road-4x4-Mountain-Truck-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="808" height="794" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-City-60447-Off-Road-4x4-Mountain-Truck-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 808w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-City-60447-Off-Road-4x4-Mountain-Truck-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x295.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-City-60447-Off-Road-4x4-Mountain-Truck-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x755.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 808px) 100vw, 808px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92572 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60464-Formula-1-F1-Williams-Racing-Haas-F1-Race-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="972" height="831" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60464-Formula-1-F1-Williams-Racing-Haas-F1-Race-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 972w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60464-Formula-1-F1-Williams-Racing-Haas-F1-Race-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x256.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60464-Formula-1-F1-Williams-Racing-Haas-F1-Race-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x657.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 972px) 100vw, 972px" /></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>40% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Minecraft-House-Figures-Playset/dp/B0DJ19VGDH?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=8a53afa4eb4d3be607949d02f6f3c467&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Minecraft The Baby Pig House 21268</a> <strong>$11.99</strong> (reg.$19.99)</li>
<li>40% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Star-Koons-Starfighter-Microfighter/dp/B0DRW5YPVY?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=da645a19a5d2fd7557ace1797fbecc91&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars Plo Koon’s Jedi Starfighter Microfighter 75400</a> <strong>$8.92</strong> (reg.$14.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96499 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75400-Plo-Koons-Jedi-Starfighter-Microfighter-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="613" height="602" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75400-Plo-Koons-Jedi-Starfighter-Microfighter-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 613w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75400-Plo-Koons-Jedi-Starfighter-Microfighter-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x295.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 613px) 100vw, 613px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-93306 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-Minecraft-21268-The-Baby-Pig-House-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="801" height="778" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-Minecraft-21268-The-Baby-Pig-House-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 801w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-Minecraft-21268-The-Baby-Pig-House-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x291.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-Minecraft-21268-The-Baby-Pig-House-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x746.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 801px) 100vw, 801px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Vanths-Speeder-Building-Girls/dp/B0FMS9FH2H?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=d4b6dd4d41470367de79fc1c3953dc2a&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars Cobb Vanth’s Speeder 75437</a> <strong>$27.99</strong> (reg.$34.99)</li>
