					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="617" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-Black-Friday-UK-United-Kingdom-November-2026-Sale.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Merlin Entertainment Black Friday UK United Kingdom November 2026 Sale" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-Black-Friday-UK-United-Kingdom-November-2026-Sale.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-Black-Friday-UK-United-Kingdom-November-2026-Sale-300x154.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-Black-Friday-UK-United-Kingdom-November-2026-Sale-1024x527.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-Black-Friday-UK-United-Kingdom-November-2026-Sale-768x395.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
