					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1158" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO DC 30762 Retro Video Game Batman GWP Mini Set Minifigure November 2026 Promo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo.png 1158w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-290x300.png 290w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-988x1024.png 988w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-768x796.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-1024x1061.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1158px) 100vw, 1158px" /></p>
<p>The highly popular exclusive LEGO DC 30762 Retro Video Game Batman Minifigure GWP Gift with Purchase is now</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-dc-30762-retro-video-game-batman-minifigure-gwp-promo-now-sold-out-in-usa-canada/">LEGO DC 30762 Retro Video Game Batman Minifigure GWP Promo Now Sold Out in USA &#038; Canada</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The highly popular exclusive LEGO DC 30762 Retro Video Game Batman Minifigure GWP Gift with Purchase is now sold out in US and Canada. This promotion <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-penguins-in-love-gwp-retro-video-game-batman-gwp-double-points-on-spongebob-squarepants-bikini-bottom-more-promos-now-live-november-9-15-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">just started live tonight</a> and within an hour or so, it went out of stock already at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). This promotion was free when you spend $40 USD / $50 CAD / £35 GBP  in LEGO DC or LEGO Batman items. Promotion runs from November 9-15, 2026 or while supplies last.</p>
<p>There may be a possibility this DC Batman minifigure gift might pop back up on the LEGO site during the promo period. However, this is a pretty popular LEGO minifigure GWP. Secondary marketplaces like at (<a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay.com USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay.ca Canada</a>) has this single minifigure fetching for pretty high dollar amounts already.</p>
<p>As of this article writing, LEGO DC 30762 Retro Video Game Batman Minifigure GWP promotion is still in-stock in the United Kingdom UK. However, it probably wouldn&#8217;t last too long considering the US and Canada markets went sold out pretty fast.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114497 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo.png" alt="" width="829" height="859" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo.png 1158w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-290x300.png 290w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-988x1024.png 988w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-768x796.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-1024x1061.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 829px) 100vw, 829px" /></p>
<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on any LEGO Deals or News by subscribing to our email list!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p>For the most up to date current LEGO promotions, offers and gift with purchase (GWP) being offered, check the official LEGO store promotional pages links below.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>US United States</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Canada</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>UK United Kingdom</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Australia</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103542 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg" alt="" width="909" height="459" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg 909w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-300x151.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-768x388.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 909px) 100vw, 909px" /></p>
