<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92969 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="970" height="855" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 970w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x264.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x677.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px" /></p>
