		<item>
		<title>[Toys N Bricks Site Update] Subscriptions for All Future Long Form LEGO Resource Guide Articles</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/toys-n-bricks-site-update-subscriptions-for-all-future-long-form-lego-resource-guide-articles/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/toys-n-bricks-site-update-subscriptions-for-all-future-long-form-lego-resource-guide-articles/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 01:19:18 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO & LEGOLAND News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Site News]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114486</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="999" height="798" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Toysnbricks Forum Less AI &amp; Algorithms, More Human Articles and Forum Chats Ad Banner Logo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 999px) 100vw, 999px" /></p>
<p>Hello LEGO Readers, Toys N Bricks is a comprehensive LEGO &#38; LEGOLAND Resource Center that has been established</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/toys-n-bricks-site-update-subscriptions-for-all-future-long-form-lego-resource-guide-articles/">[Toys N Bricks Site Update] Subscriptions for All Future Long Form LEGO Resource Guide Articles</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Hello LEGO Readers, Toys N Bricks is a comprehensive LEGO &amp; LEGOLAND Resource Center that has been established for 17 years since the year 2009. In an unprecedented challenging and complex AI era, we are making changes and adjustments to enhance our media publication services and offerings. These changes are necessary to ensure the long term viability of Toys N Bricks so that it can continue to be passed on from one generation to another.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112591 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Toysnbricks.com-Banner-Logo-Humans-First-Ad-Times-are-Changing-Humans-First.jpg" alt="" width="447" height="522" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Toysnbricks.com-Banner-Logo-Humans-First-Ad-Times-are-Changing-Humans-First.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Toysnbricks.com-Banner-Logo-Humans-First-Ad-Times-are-Changing-Humans-First-257x300.jpg 257w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Toysnbricks.com-Banner-Logo-Humans-First-Ad-Times-are-Changing-Humans-First-877x1024.jpg 877w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Toysnbricks.com-Banner-Logo-Humans-First-Ad-Times-are-Changing-Humans-First-768x897.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 447px) 100vw, 447px" /></p>
<h3>Changes to Toys N Bricks LEGO Resource Guides</h3>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Toys N Bricks is free of charge to everyone. <strong>We will <span style="text-decoration: underline;">not implement any paywalls</span> for our LEGO &amp; LEGOLAND News, Sales &amp; Deals, Reviews and Travel Planning Guides articles. </strong>The majority of our human written LEGO content and articles will continue to be 100% free to access.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">With that said, some of our long form LEGO Resource Guides articles take many hours of work to research, draft, write, review and publish. Effective November 8, 2026, <strong>all future</strong> long form <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> including our Tips &amp; Tricks and Display &amp; Storage Solutions articles will require a <a href="https://www.patreon.com/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener">paid Patreon subscription tier</a>. We typically<strong> publish anywhere from <span style="text-decoration: underline;">2 to 6</span> of these long form LEGO Resource Guides articles a month</strong>. For a better reading experience, the majority of our LEGO Resource Guides will have <span style="text-decoration: underline;">no display programmatic advertisements</span> (long form resource guide articles published after November 8, 2026).</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Introductory promo subscription pricing for our <strong>Brick Supporter Premium Tier</strong> will be <strong>$3 USD (~$4.5 CAD) per month</strong>. You will be grandfathered and locked into this plan price if you sign up now. On January 1, 2027, new subscription prices goes up to <strong>$6 USD (~$8.5 CAD) per month</strong>. Old and already published LEGO Resource articles prior to November 8, 2026 will continue to be free and accessible to all.</p>
<p>Other benefits of our Brick Supporter Premium Tier include the following (in <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">our LEGO forums</a>):</p>
<ul>
<li data-pm-slice="1 1 [&quot;bulletList&quot;,{},&quot;listItem&quot;,{&quot;closed&quot;:false,&quot;nested&quot;:false}]"><strong>Exclusive Building Contests &amp; Giveaway Prizes only for Brick Supporter Premium Tier and Platinum Elite Tier Members</strong></li>
<li data-pm-slice="1 1 [&quot;bulletList&quot;,{},&quot;listItem&quot;,{&quot;closed&quot;:false,&quot;nested&quot;:false}]"><strong>Exclusive Access to Premium &amp; Platinum Elite Tier only forum section</strong></li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://www.patreon.com/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-111285 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks.jpg" alt="" width="697" height="253" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks.jpg 697w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks-300x109.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 697px) 100vw, 697px" /></a></p>
<p>This also a hybrid approach where we are balancing the prospect of protecting our human written articles and content from AI and bots scraping. At the same time, we want to also ensure that most of our human written content articles are still available, accessible and free for everyone.</p>
<p>As our advertising and affiliate revenue declines and our expenses and costs continue to go up, your subscription will also help us cover some our operational expenses. These include IT infrastructure, servers, licenses, software, staffing, community contest giveaways and more.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.patreon.com/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Patreon</a> will be handling all the monthly subscription payments, billing and accounting. We don&#8217;t do any of this in-house anymore as we are simplifying and restructuring our operations.</p>
<p>From the bottom of our hearts, thank you for your understanding and for your support.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-109205 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Toysnbricks-Logo-Humans-First-Always-Banner-900-x150.jpg" alt="" width="900" height="150" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Toysnbricks-Logo-Humans-First-Always-Banner-900-x150.jpg 900w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Toysnbricks-Logo-Humans-First-Always-Banner-900-x150-300x50.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Toysnbricks-Logo-Humans-First-Always-Banner-900-x150-768x128.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="628" height="502" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 628px) 100vw, 628px" /></p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/toys-n-bricks-site-update-subscriptions-for-all-future-long-form-lego-resource-guide-articles/">[Toys N Bricks Site Update] Subscriptions for All Future Long Form LEGO Resource Guide Articles</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.toysnbricks.com/toys-n-bricks-site-update-subscriptions-for-all-future-long-form-lego-resource-guide-articles/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>[Review] LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP (November 2026 Promo Gift Set)</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/review-lego-ideas-40889-build-paint-and-play-gwp-november-2026-promo-gift-set/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/review-lego-ideas-40889-build-paint-and-play-gwp-november-2026-promo-gift-set/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 03:58:50 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[18+/Hard to Find Theme]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[IDEAS Theme]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO & LEGOLAND News]]></category>
