<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114465 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="921" height="691" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Front-Box.jpg 921w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Front-Box-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Front-Box-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 921px) 100vw, 921px" /></p>
