<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114466 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Top-Box.jpg" alt="" width="921" height="691" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Top-Box.jpg 921w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Top-Box-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Top-Box-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 921px) 100vw, 921px" /></p>
<p>This is how the back of the box looks like. It shows the dimensions and how big the set is too.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114467 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="921" height="691" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Back-Box.jpg 921w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Back-Box-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Back-Box-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 921px) 100vw, 921px" /></p>
<p>Dumping out the box, you get two numbered bags. You also get a few white plate pieces along with a sticker sheet.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114468 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Box-Contents.jpg" alt="" width="921" height="691" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Box-Contents.jpg 921w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Box-Contents-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Box-Contents-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 921px) 100vw, 921px" /></p>
<p>Here&#8217;s a closer look at the sticker sheet. There&#8217;s stickers for ruler metric measurements, colors and more.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114469 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Sticker-Sheet.jpg" alt="" width="921" height="691" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Sticker-Sheet.jpg 921w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Sticker-Sheet-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Sticker-Sheet-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 921px) 100vw, 921px" /></p>
<p>I always enjoy instruction booklets that talk a bit about the set and the designer. Here, you get to learn a bit about the LEGO IDEAS fan designer for this GWP gift set.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114470 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Instructions-Booklet.jpg" alt="" width="921" height="691" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Instructions-Booklet.jpg 921w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Instructions-Booklet-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Instructions-Booklet-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 921px) 100vw, 921px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The Build Process &#8211; 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP</span></h3>
<p>You first start with bag 1 building the spaceman minifigure along with his accessory.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114471 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Minifigure.jpg" alt="" width="921" height="691" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Minifigure.jpg 921w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 921px) 100vw, 921px" /></p>
<p>Here is how the back of the minifigure looks like.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114472 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Back-Minifigure.jpg" alt="" width="921" height="691" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Back-Minifigure.jpg 921w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Back-Minifigure-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Back-Minifigure-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 921px) 100vw, 921px" /></p>
<p>Bag 1 basically builds the base of the set. You build three different paint colors too. Spare pieces for bag 1 are shown as well.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114473 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Bag-1-Build.jpg" alt="" width="921" height="691" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Bag-1-Build.jpg 921w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Bag-1-Build-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Bag-1-Build-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 921px) 100vw, 921px" /></p>
<p>Bag 2 finishes up with the other sections of the set. You build other parts such as the glue, paint, brush and more. Spare pieces for bag 2 are shown as well in the picture below.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114474 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Bag-2-Build.jpg" alt="" width="921" height="691" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Bag-2-Build.jpg 921w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Bag-2-Build-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Bag-2-Build-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 921px) 100vw, 921px" /></p>
<p>Here&#8217;s a closer look at the set from another angle.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114475 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Back.jpg" alt="" width="921" height="691" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Back.jpg 921w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Back-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Back-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 921px) 100vw, 921px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The Complete Set &amp; Final Thoughts &#8211; 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP</span></h3>
<p>It took me around 30 minutes to build this set. Its a pretty fast and quick build as there are only 158 pieces in the set. The set is neat as your essentially building an arts and crafts set. I think this would be great for display when putting it in your office or at your home.</p>
<p>LEGO 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP is currently available at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). The promotion runs from October 28 to November 8, 2026 (or while supplies last) and is free with purchases of $130 USD / $170 CAD / £115 GBP / $210 AUD at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p>You can also buy LEGO 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP by itself on secondary marketplaces (<a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> and <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a>).</p>
<p><strong>What do you think of the LEGO 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP? You can vote and <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3403-review-lego-ideas-40889-build-paint-and-play-gwp-november-2026-promo-gift-set/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">let us know in the forums</a>.</strong></p>
<p><em>Thank you to LEGO for providing Toys N Bricks a media copy sample of the LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP for us to review. </em></p>
